    "message_id": "01M46VN2T5VVXX6G8TGBHPF4D7",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Hi {{ person.first_name|default:'there' }},"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Benjamin here, founder of Siraat. I want to tell you the story behind our non-toxic pans."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The hammered titanium pan — Siraat started that category. Our first orders shipped December 20, 2024, and at that point nobody else was making a pan like this: pure titanium cooking surface, hammered pattern, no coating of any kind. We developed it ourselves, and we're proud of it."
      },
      {
        "type": "button",
        "text": "See the pan →",
        "href": "https://siraatskitchen.com/"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Since then, look-alikes have appeared. Same shape. Similar claims. Different materials in the fine print."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "I started Siraat because I believed a pan with nothing added to it could cook just as well as one built around a coating — better, actually. The hammered pattern creates tiny points of contact between the food and the surface. Less surface touching the pan means less sticking. And because there's nothing on the surface, there's nothing to scratch, wear, or wonder about years from now."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "That's still the whole idea."
      },
      {
        "type": "button",
        "text": "Shop what we built →",
        "href": "https://siraatskitchen.com/"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Benjamin"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Founder, Siraat"
      },
      {
        "type": "footer",
        "note": "Plain-text template: no designed footer; Klaviyo appends standard unsubscribe block"
      }
    ]
